"└─┌Help──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐─┘"
"┌L│Everywhere                                                                │─┐"
"│N│  q  Ctrl-C       quit (Ctrl-C stops a running scan first)                │ │"
"│T│  ?  Esc          open / close this help                                  │ │"
"└─│  1-5  < >        Dashboard, File browser, Duplicates, Organize, History  │─┘"
"┌F│  Shift ← →       previous / next screen (plain ← → on most screens)      │─┐"
"│w│  T               pick a screen with ← →, then Enter                      │ │"
"│ │  r  c            scan again for changes / cancel the running scan        │ │"
"│ │  R               forget what is saved and scan from scratch (asks first) │ │"
"│ │  W               write mode on (asks first) / off                        │ │"
"│ │  D               debug overlay: frame time, fetch time                   │─┘"
"│ │Yojaka has no undo: a move or a copy is final                             │─┐"
